<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#090b20">
<meta name="description" content="Kids Cartoon World — Explore, learn, draw, play and discover a magical world of learning!">
<title>Kids Cartoon World | Explore the Magic</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap');

:root {
  --bg: #090b20;
  --panel: rgba(255,255,255,.075);
  --border: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  --text: #f8f7ff;
  --muted: #a7accd;
  --pink: #ff62b0;
  --blue: #63b9ff;
  --purple: #a58bff;
  --green: #57efb2;
  --yellow: #ffdc75;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--text);
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 0%, #24235a 0, transparent 35%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 30%, #24133e 0, transparent 32%),
    var(--bg);
  font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

button, input, select { font: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }

button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--yellow);
  outline-offset: 4px;
}

a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

#stars {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: -1;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.star {
  position: absolute;
  width: 3px;
  height: 3px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fff;
  opacity: .55;
  animation: twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes twinkle {
  from { opacity: .15; transform: scale(.7); }
  to { opacity: .85; transform: scale(1.5); }
}

header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 20;
  background: rgba(9,11,32,.82);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
}

.nav {
  max-width: 1250px;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  margin: auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 15px;
}

.logo {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 22px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.logo-icon {
  width: 43px;
  height: 43px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--purple), var(--blue));
  border-radius: 15px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 28px #a58bff40;
}

.logo span:last-child {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, #bdaaff, #ff9ed2);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  color: transparent;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 22px;
  align-items: center;
}

.nav-links a {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
  transition: .2s;
}

.nav-links a:hover { color: white; }

.profile {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 7px 12px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.avatar {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb4d9, #9b8bff);
}

main {
  max-width: 1250px;
  padding: 30px 22px 70px;
  margin: auto;
}

.hero {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  min-height: 400px;
  padding: 45px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 34px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 50%, #8b6cff30, transparent 45%),
    linear-gradient(125deg, #211c49, #14162f 60%, #24204b);
  box-shadow: 0 25px 100px #00000025;
}

.hero::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 340px;
  height: 340px;
  border: 1px solid #ffffff12;
  border-radius: 50%;
  right: 5%;
  top: 5%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 35px #ffffff05, 0 0 0 70px #ffffff03;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 8px 13px;
  border: 1px solid #a58bff50;
  background: #a58bff15;
  color: #d2c5ff;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(38px, 5.4vw, 69px);
  line-height: .99;
  margin: 23px 0 15px;
  letter-spacing: -1.5px;
}

.gradient-text {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8dc8, #b3a0ff, #72d7ff);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  color: transparent;
}

.hero p {
  max-width: 490px;
  color: #bfc3df;
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

.btn {
  border: 0;
  padding: 13px 20px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  font-weight: 900;
  transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}

.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }

.btn-primary {
  color: #11102a;
  background: linear-gradient(100deg, #ff91cb, #b8a4ff);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #bb83ff30;
}

.btn-secondary {
  color: white;
  background: #ffffff0b;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.hero-art {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 285px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}

.planet {
  position: absolute;
  width: 235px;
  height: 235px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, #ffb3d7, #ab82ff 42%, #4b64db 75%, #282b77);
  box-shadow: inset -22px -20px 40px #17164c70, 0 0 65px #987dff45;
  animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.planet::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 310px;
  height: 78px;
  border: 13px solid #d9c6ff;
  border-left-color: #ffb4da;
  border-right-color: #6dcbff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  transform: rotate(-22deg);
  left: -38px;
  top: 83px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px #ad8cff40;
}

.planet-face {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 92px;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 10px #21133a45);
}

.orbit-star {
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 36px;
  animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.s1 { top: 5%; right: 8%; }
.s2 { left: 4%; top: 30%; animation-delay: -1s; }
.s3 { right: 6%; bottom: 5%; animation-delay: -2s; }

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-12px) rotate(3deg); }
}

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 14px;
  margin: 23px 0 42px;
}

.stat {
  padding: 19px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 13px;
}

.stat-icon {
  font-size: 26px;
  width: 49px;
  height: 49px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background: #ffffff0b;
  border-radius: 15px;
}

.stat strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 21px;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.stat small { color: var(--muted); }

.section { margin-top: 43px; scroll-margin-top: 95px; }

.section-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: end;
  gap: 15px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.section-head h2 {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 35px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin: 0 0 5px;
}

.section-head p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

.pill {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--panel);
  color: #d7d9f1;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 17px;
}

.card {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 23px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 24px;
  background: var(--panel);
  transition: transform .25s, border-color .25s, background .25s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px);
  border-color: #a58bff70;
  background: #ffffff0d;
}

.card-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
}

.card-emoji {
  width: 58px;
  height: 58px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 32px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a58bff25, #ff62b015);
}

.tag {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 900;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  color: #cbbfff;
  background: #a58bff18;
}

.card h3 {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
  font-size: 23px;
  margin: 18px 0 5px;
}

.card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  min-height: 45px;
  margin: 0 0 19px;
}

.card .btn { width: 100%; }

.card-pink .card-emoji { background: #ff62b018; }
.card-blue .card-emoji { background: #63b9ff18; }
.card-green .card-emoji { background: #57efb218; }
.card-yellow .card-emoji { background: #ffdc7518; }

.panel {
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--panel);
}

.toolbar {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

select, input[type="text"] {
  min-width: 0;
  color: white;
  background: #15172f;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 11px 13px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

select option { background: #15172f; }

.quiz-question {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
  line-height: 1.3;
  margin: 16px 0 22px;
}

.answers {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
}

.answer {
  text-align: left;
  color: white;
  background: #ffffff08;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
  transition: .2s;
}

.answer:hover { border-color: var(--purple); }
.answer.correct { background: #57efb220; border-color: var(--green); }
.answer.wrong { background: #ff6c8a20; border-color: #ff6c8a; }

.feedback {
  min-height: 28px;
  margin: 15px 0;
  color: var(--green);
  font-weight: 900;
}

.progress {
  height: 7px;
  background: #ffffff12;
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  width: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink), var(--purple), var(--blue));
  transition: width .3s;
}

.learning-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 13px;
}

.learn-item {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 19px 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: #ffffff05;
  border-radius: 18px;
}

.learn-item .big { font-size: 35px; }
.learn-item h3 { font-size: 16px; margin: 10px 0 5px; }
.learn-item p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }

.canvas-wrap {
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #fff;
}

#drawing {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 320px;
  touch-action: none;
  cursor: crosshair;
}

.draw-controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.draw-controls label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.draw-controls input[type="range"] { width: 100px; }
.draw-controls input[type="color"] {
  width: 40px;
  height: 36px;
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
}

.achievements {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 13px;
}

.badge {
  padding: 18px 12px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: #ffffff05;
  border-radius: 18px;
  opacity: .45;
  filter: grayscale(1);
}

.badge.unlocked { opacity: 1; filter: none; border-color: #ffdc7555; }
.badge div { font-size: 31px; }
.badge strong { display: block; margin: 9px 0 4px; }
.badge small { color: var(--muted); }

footer {
  margin-top: 60px;
  padding: 32px 10px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--muted);
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

footer strong { color: white; }

.toast {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 50;
  bottom: 22px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, 120px);
  padding: 13px 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: #252346;
  border-radius: 15px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px #0005;
  font-weight: 800;
  transition: transform .3s;
  text-align: center;
  width: max-content;
  max-width: calc(100% - 30px);
}

.toast.show { transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

.modal {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 60;
  background: #050615d9;
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  display: none;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 20px;
}

.modal.open { display: grid; }

.modal-box {
  max-width: 460px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 30px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 27px;
  background: #191a3a;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 100px #0007;
}

.modal-box .big { font-size: 55px; }
.modal-box h2 { font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif; font-size: 29px; }
.modal-box p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
.modal-box input { width: 100%; margin: 12px 0; }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .nav-links { gap: 12px; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 12px; }
  .hero { padding: 30px; }
  .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .learning-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .nav { padding: 11px 14px; }
  .logo { font-size: 17px; }
  .logo-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  main { padding: 18px 14px 45px; }
  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 26px 22px; border-radius: 25px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 48px; }
  .hero-art { min-height: 235px; }
  .planet { width: 175px; height: 175px; }
  .planet::before { width: 235px; height: 60px; left: -30px; top: 60px; border-width: 10px; }
  .planet-face { font-size: 70px; }
  .stats { gap: 10px; }
  .stat { padding: 12px; gap: 9px; }
  .stat-icon { width: 39px; height: 39px; font-size: 22px; }
  .stat strong { font-size: 18px; }
  .stat small { font-size: 11px; }
  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .section-head { align-items: start; }
  .panel { padding: 16px; }
  .answers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .learning-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .achievements { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  #drawing { height: 270px; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: .01ms !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition-duration: .01ms !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div id="stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header>
  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="#home" class="logo" aria-label="Kids Cartoon World home">
      <span class="logo-icon">🌈</span>
      <span>Kids Cartoon World</span>
    </a>

    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#explore">Explore</a>
      <a href="#quiz">Quiz</a>
      <a href="#learn">Learn</a>
      <a href="#draw">Draw</a>
    </div>

    <button class="profile" id="profileButton" type="button">
      <span class="avatar">🧑‍🚀</span>
      <span id="navName">Explorer</span>
    </button>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">✨ YOUR UNIVERSE OF FUN</span>
      <h1>Little minds.<br><span class="gradient-text">Big adventures.</span></h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to a magical universe where curiosity becomes an adventure!
        Play fun quizzes, discover amazing facts, create colorful art and
        collect rewards as you learn.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="startButton">🚀 Start Exploring</button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="heroQuizButton">🧠 Play a Quiz</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="A magical smiling planet">
      <span class="orbit-star s1">⭐</span>
      <span class="orbit-star s2">✨</span>
      <span class="orbit-star s3">🪐</span>
      <div class="planet">
        <div class="planet-face">😊</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats" aria-label="Your progress">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-icon">⭐</div>
      <div><strong id="points">0</strong><small>Magic points</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-icon">🧩</div>
      <div><strong id="answered">0</strong><small>Quiz answers</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-icon">🏆</div>
      <div><strong id="unlocked">0/4</strong><small>Achievements</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-icon">🎨</div>
      <div><strong id="artCount">0</strong><small>Artworks saved</small></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="explore">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2>Explore your universe 🌌</h2>
        <p>Choose your next adventure!</p>
      </div>
      <span class="pill">6 EXPERIENCES</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card card-pink">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-emoji">🧠</div><span class="tag">THINK & WIN</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Brainy Quiz</h3>
        <p>Test your knowledge with fun questions about science, nature, space and more.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-go="quiz">Play Quiz →</button>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-blue">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-emoji">🌍</div><span class="tag">DISCOVER</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Wonder World</h3>
        <p>Explore fascinating facts about our planet, the human body and the universe.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-go="learn">Discover Facts →</button>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-green">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-emoji">🎨</div><span class="tag">GET CREATIVE</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Drawing Studio</h3>
        <p>Make your own masterpiece using colors, different brush sizes and your imagination.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-go="draw">Create Art →</button>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-yellow">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-emoji">🔢</div><span class="tag">LEVEL UP</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Math Challenge</h3>
        <p>Sharpen your maths skills with a new arithmetic challenge every round.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="mathButton">Start Challenge →</button>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-blue">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-emoji">🔤</div><span class="tag">WORD POWER</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Word Explorer</h3>
        <p>Discover useful English words and their meanings in a simple, friendly way.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-go="words">Explore Words →</button>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-pink">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-emoji">🏆</div><span class="tag">YOUR JOURNEY</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Achievement Hall</h3>
        <p>See which milestones you have unlocked while exploring your learning universe.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-go="achievements">View Rewards →</button>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="quiz">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2>Brainy Quiz 🧠</h2>
        <p>Pick an answer and earn magic points!</p>
      </div>
      <span class="pill" id="quizCounter">QUESTION 1</span>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <div class="toolbar">
        <select id="subject" aria-label="Quiz subject">
          <option value="all">🌈 All Subjects</option>
          <option value="science">🔬 Science</option>
          <option value="nature">🌿 Nature</option>
          <option value="space">🚀 Space</option>
